  "id": "change-management",
  "term": "change management",
  "definition": "Change management is the planned handling of organizational change as a core part of strategy, with attention to how change approaches fit a specific work setting. In this context, it includes understanding employees’ engagement, satisfaction, and views so decisions about change can be better adapted to the environment.",
